      "content": "yeah, i'll check the OOMKilled status. but it feels almost intentional, like something is messing with the cluster behind our backs. it's like these little glitches just appear out of nowhere and mess up things that were working fine a second ago.\n\nany other weird edge cases we should look for? specifically things that might not show up in the standard metrics or logs?",
